The icon outlines used by this card are the "dishwasher", "washing-machine", "tumble-dryer",
"robot-vacuum" and "robot-mower" icons from Material Design Icons by Pictogrammers
(https://pictogrammers.com/library/mdi/), licensed under the Apache License 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).
The icon paths are embedded in dist/mdi-animated-appliances.js; the animation overlays
are original work released under the MIT License of this repository.
